## How navigation from Home works (row tap vs button tap)

Code-behind ensures that tapping on controls (buttons/switches) does not trigger navigation:
- `Home.xaml.cs` checks tap position vs interactive controls
- if tap is not on a control, it executes `HomeViewModel.ViewScheduleCommand`

Files:
- `src/Bible.Alarm/Views/Home.xaml.cs`
- `src/Bible.Alarm/ViewModels/HomeViewModelHelpers/CommandHandler.cs`

